WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:01.710
♪♪

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:02.878
Bush:
Good morning.

00:00:02.878 --> 00:00:04.171
How are you?

00:00:04.171 --> 00:00:07.466
Ann Compton:
It was absolutely
spectacular weather.

00:00:07.466 --> 00:00:09.009
Ann Compton:
Not humid,

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:10.969
Ann Compton:
skies were clearer,

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:13.055
TV reporter:
Smoke is billowing out of the
building...

00:00:13.055 --> 00:00:14.306
AP Network News,

00:00:14.306 --> 00:00:18.143
News Reporter:
A plane apparently has crashed
into the World Trade Center in New York.

00:00:18.769 --> 00:00:23.398
We went from a very calm
beautiful day to one in which
our world changed dramatically.

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:24.441
♪♪

00:00:24.441 --> 00:00:28.987
Narrator:
September 11th, 2001 was the
worst terrorist attack in U.S. history.

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:33.700
Narrator:
Now experience the first twelve
hours surrounding the events.

00:00:34.451 --> 00:00:36.495
Narrator:
In a way the world has never
seen.

00:00:36.495 --> 00:00:38.538
♪♪

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:42.125
Bush:
Andy Card comes up behind me and
says, "America's under attack." 

00:00:42.125 --> 00:00:44.044
And I'm watching a child read.

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:46.588
Eddie Marinzel:
We needed to move the president
and get him out of there. 

00:00:46.588 --> 00:00:48.090
He could be a sitting duck.

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:49.258
♪♪

00:00:49.258 --> 00:00:52.177
There was a call that said
"Angel's next." 

00:00:52.177 --> 00:00:54.388
Angel is the code word for Air
Force One.

00:00:54.972 --> 00:00:58.725
We worried someone in the
president's circle could try to
take down Air Force One.

00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:03.230
Every plane had become a
missile.

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:05.190
One of the targets might well be
The White House.

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:08.193
Air traffic control:
All aircraft land as soon as
possible.

00:01:08.193 --> 00:01:09.278
Bush:
Mother got on the phone.

00:01:09.278 --> 00:01:10.904
Bush:
She said, we're outside
Milwaukee.

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:11.905
Bush:
I said, you gotta be kidding me.

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:12.906
Bush:
What are you doing there?

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:15.033
She said, you grounded our
plane.

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:16.535
Narrator:
In their own words.

00:01:16.535 --> 00:01:19.496
She told me her plane had been
hijacked. 

00:01:19.496 --> 00:01:20.580
Theodore Olson:
And the line went dead.

00:01:21.999 --> 00:01:23.041
(Choked up)
That really hit home.

00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:25.836
Narrator:
Those at the heart of power on
that unforgettable day.

00:01:25.836 --> 00:01:27.921
Condoleezza:
We did everything we knew to do,

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:30.924
Condoleezza:
but 3,000 people died on your
watch.

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:32.259
It just gnaws at you.

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:36.096
Narrator:
Come together to reveal what
happened behind closed doors.

00:01:36.972 --> 00:01:39.474
Karl Rove:
She took the badge from her
son's dead body,

00:01:39.474 --> 00:01:44.896
gave it to the president and
said, "I...I want you to always
remember".

00:01:45.814 --> 00:01:49.359
I remember the Secret Service
screaming, take of your heels
and run!

00:01:49.359 --> 00:01:51.194
We never had a crisis quite like
this.

00:01:51.653 --> 00:01:53.030
Colin Powell:
Of course we all were hurting. 

00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:54.406
We all were terrified.

00:01:55.032 --> 00:01:56.825
Bush:
The first plane was an accident.

00:01:56.825 --> 00:01:57.784
The second one was an attack.

00:01:59.161 --> 00:02:01.038
Bush:
And the third one was a
declaration of war.

